Value Filldown target ([0-9a-fA-F:.]+)
Value packets_sent (\d+)
Value packets_received (\d+)
Value loss_pct (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value rtt_min_ms (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value rtt_avg_ms (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value rtt_max_ms (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)

Start
  ^\s+sent=${packets_sent}\s+received=${packets_received}\s+packet-loss=${loss_pct}%\s+min-rtt=${rtt_min_ms}ms\d+us\s+avg-rtt=${rtt_avg_ms}ms\d+us
  ^\s*max-rtt=${rtt_max_ms}ms\d+us\s+$$ -> Record
